    "alt": "A graph of four nodes A, B, C, D. The node being visited is drawn with a heavy outline, nodes already visited keep a medium outline. A tall box on the right is the stack, and letters fade into it as nodes are pushed, then fade out from the top as the search backtracks; at the end the four nodes flash in visit order A, B, D, C.",
    "reducedMotion": "Show four static panels: the graph after each push with the current path drawn thick, the stack contents beside each panel, and a final panel listing visit order A, B, D, C with the backtrack path marked as a dashed retrace.",
